    "purpose": "Score CONVERSATIONAL quality, which the golden suite cannot. The golden judge grades every answer on factual grounding and detail, so a correct short reply to 'Hey! How are you?' scores 1.33/5 — penalising exactly the behaviour we want. These cases are scored on brevity, staying on the point, and not volunteering group facts nobody asked for.",
